; D7-exec happy path: filesystem resolver pairs `manifests/double.sjon`
; with the sidecar `manifests/double.wasm`. Web + Rust hosts instantiate
; the plugin, pre-flight passes, and `(double 21)` evaluates to 42 with
; zero diagnostics. Zig-native + TS-parity skip this case (declarative-
; only — no wasm runtime adapter wired).
(use-plugin "double")

(double 21)
